{"id":"d9a5da30a128644f","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-logic-definable-set.md","title":"ZFC Logic Definable Set","display":"df-zfc-logic-definable-set — ZFC Logic Definable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic-definable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic-definable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-logic-definable-set — ZFC Logic Definable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-definable]]","[[58-df-logic]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic-definable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic-definable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic-definable-set — ZFC Logic Definable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a63c990f1580982\" href=\"?note=9a63c990f1580982\" title=\"58-df-definable\">58-df-definable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"44e32f3fb4334e0c\" href=\"?note=44e32f3fb4334e0c\" title=\"58-df-logic\">58-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> (candidate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (universe of the structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L\\)</span> (formula with one distinguished free variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> (assignment encoding the parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (definable set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (element bound in the comprehension)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (structure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Assign},\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Assign},\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (semantic and syntax predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\">\\(\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\)</span> (semantic maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableSet}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableSet}_S(D,\\mathfrak A,\\varphi,s,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\land D=\\{a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto a])\\}\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableSet}_S(D,\\mathfrak A,\\varphi,s,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\land D=\\{a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto a])\\}\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The language, formula, assignment, and the satisfaction map witnessing its semantics are all explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-definable","status":"resolved","id":"9a63c990f1580982","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-definable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"44e32f3fb4334e0c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_L","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S,\\mathrm{Assign},\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableSet}_S(D,\\mathfrak A,\\varphi,s,L)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\land D=\\{a\\in\\operatorname{Univ}(\\mathfrak A):\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[v_0\\mapsto a])\\}\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1689,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anc